<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH JULY JOBLESS RATE RISES TO 4.3 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>CZECH JULY JOBLESS RATE RISES TO 4.3 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech unemployment rose to 4.3 percent of the workforce at the end of July from 4.0 percent in June, the Labour and Social Affairs Ministry said in a statement on Thursday.  </p>
<p>  CZECH UNEMPLOYMENT	 JULY 1997   JUNE 1997    JULY 1996</p>
<p>  total jobless		 222,374     202,562	158,252</p>
<p>  percentage of workforce   4.3	   4.0	    3.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Measures through end of period listed.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
